.env
node_modules/
*.log
data/cache/
data/.macro-ping-state.json
data/.telegram-update-offset.json
data/.crypto-alert-dedup.json
data/alert-log.json

# NOTE: data/news-cache/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It is derived data, but
# Google News re-ranks and drops items over time, so re-fetching later yields
# a different corpus — committing the cache is what keeps the news backtest
# numbers reproducible, and it saves ~10 minutes of rate-limited requests.

# Cached OKX candles + signal dates for the Python analysis layer.
# Committed on purpose: refetching costs ~20 minutes of rate-limited requests
# and the candles are immutable history, so caching them makes every analysis
# reproducible and instant. 1.7MB.

# 4H candle cache — NOT committed, unlike data/export/.
# The daily cache underpins the validated setup and is worth its 1.7MB. The 4H
# test was rejected (edge flipped sign between halves), so this cache has no
# ongoing value and would only grow the repo. Regenerate with
# `node src/analysis/fourHourTest.js` if the 4H question is ever reopened.
data/export-4h/
